  <name>The Causeway IV</name>
  <description>1 effort block peaking at 67% in 120 minutes. Picture yourself cruising along a flat coastal road with no deadlines. This lays the aerobic groundwork that makes every other workout more effective. The effort should feel sustainable all day long.</description>
